The word is "aaabbb".
The size is the length of word.
The table is a list of 36 zeros.
For every spot from 0 to size minus 1.
Set item (spot times size plus spot) of table to 1.

For every span from 2 to size.
For every start from 0 to size minus span.
The finish is start plus span minus 1.
The opener is item ((start plus 1) times size plus finish) of table plus 1.
For every split from start plus 1 to finish.
The firstletter is the slice of word from start to start plus 1.
The otherletter is the slice of word from split to split plus 1.
The same is 0.
If firstletter matches otherletter, set same to 1.
The leftpart is 0.
If split is more than start plus 1, set leftpart to item ((start plus 1) times size plus split minus 1) of table.
The option is leftpart plus item (split times size plus finish) of table.
If same is 1 and option is less than opener, set opener to option.
If split is finish, set item (start times size plus finish) of table to opener.

Show item (size minus 1) of table.
